cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use TinyTouch in your research, please cite the software using this
  metadata and the version you used.
type: software
title: TinyTouch
authors:
  - family-names: Navara
    given-names: Lukáš
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5725-9021
version: 9.0.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Humanoids-CTU/tiny-touch
url: https://github.com/Humanoids-CTU/tiny-touch
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  TinyTouch is a desktop tool for frame-by-frame annotation of infant self-touch
  in behavioral research. It records limb-to-body-zone contacts, onset and offset
  events, gaze, and configurable annotation parameters, and exports structured
  datasets and analysis reports.
keywords:
  - video annotation
  - infant development
  - self-touch
  - behavioral research
